# game/ch01.rpy:12
translate english ch1_59ba658d:

    # n "周五的傍晚，作业全部完成，终于到了轻松的游戏时间。"
    n "Friday evening. Homework's all done — finally time to relax and game."

# game/ch01.rpy:13
translate english ch1_d5031589:

    # n "阿狐和班里大多数同学一样，喜欢玩一款休闲小游戏。看着同学们炫酷的限定皮肤、专属游戏特效，心里一直很羡慕。"
    n "Like most of his classmates, Ahu loves this casual mobile game. Watching everyone show off their flashy limited skins and exclusive effects, he couldn't help feeling jealous."

# game/ch01.rpy:14
translate english ch1_2ea02bb1:

    # n "可正版皮肤价格很贵，自己从来舍不得让爸爸妈妈花钱。这一份小小的期待，悄悄被网络里的骗子盯上了。"
    n "But official skins are super expensive, and he never wanted to ask Mom and Dad to spend money on them. That tiny hope was exactly what the scammers online were watching for."

# game/ch01.rpy:17
translate english ch1_06ce0b07:

    # n "阿狐坐在书桌前，点开手机游戏，熟练打完一把对局，返回游戏大厅。"
    n "Ahu sat at his desk, opened the game on his phone, finished a round like a pro, and went back to the lobby."

# game/ch01.rpy:20
translate english ch1_6c4e9824:

    # n "游戏私信红点闪烁，陌生用户发来好友申请与私信——对方头像带着官方标识，昵称：游戏福利客服06号。"
    n "A red notification dot blinked in his messages — a stranger sent a friend request and a private message. The avatar had an official-looking badge, and the username was Game Rewards Support 06."

# game/ch01.rpy:23
translate english ch1_1e497219:

    # fraud laugh "同学你好！系统检测到你是长期活跃优质玩家！本周末开启学生专属免费福利活动，绝版限定皮肤+1000点券全程0元领取，不充值、不花钱，仅限未成年学生！"
    fraud laugh "Hey there! Our system detected that you're a long-term active player! This weekend we're running a student-only free reward event: limited-edition skin + 1,000 points, totally free — no recharge, no spending, just for underage students!"

# game/ch01.rpy:24
translate english ch1_98d97516:

    # fraud laugh "名额仅剩最后3位，我专门为你保留了通道，错过永久绝版！"
    fraud laugh "Only 3 spots left! I saved one just for you — miss this and the skin is gone forever!"

# game/ch01.rpy:38
translate english ch1_A_ff37cbee:

    # n "阿狐眼神坚定，想起学校反诈班会的内容，毫不犹豫点击「拒绝申请」，一键拉黑、举报违规用户。"
    n "Ahu's eyes sharpened as he remembered the anti-fraud class at school. Without a second thought, he tapped \"Decline Request\", then blocked and reported the account in one click."

# game/ch01.rpy:39
translate english ch1_A_05a84097:

    # think serious "学校反诈班会教过我，天上不会掉馅饼，这种私聊就是陷阱！"
    think serious "The anti-fraud class taught me: nothing falls from the sky. Private chats like this are traps!"

# game/ch01.rpy:40
translate english ch1_A_a4126e0c:

    # mc serious "天下没有免费的皮肤，官方不会私下找我送福利。"
    mc serious "There’s no such thing as free skins. The official team would never message me privately to hand out rewards."

# game/ch01.rpy:43
translate english ch1_A_0bf2058b:

    # n "陌生私信消失，游戏界面恢复干净，无任何骚扰。"
    n "The stranger's messages disappeared, and the game went back to normal — no more harassment."

# game/ch01.rpy:46
translate english ch1_A_dc389b35:

    # police laugh "小朋友太棒了！正规游戏官方的所有福利，只会发布在游戏官方活动页面，任何私人私信、陌生客服私聊送皮肤、送点券，全部都是诈骗陷阱。不贪心、不搭理、直接举报，就是保护自己最好的方式！"
    police laugh "Nice work, kid! Real game rewards are only posted on the official event page. Any private message or random support account offering skins or points is a scam. Don’t be greedy, don’t respond, and report it right away — that’s the best way to protect yourself!"

# game/ch01.rpy:58
translate english ch1_B_ff6f36b7:

    # n "阿狐眼睛一亮，心生期待，手指打字回复对方。"
    n "Ahu's eyes lit up. He got excited and started typing a reply."

# game/ch01.rpy:59
translate english ch1_B_03a3ec7a:

    # think laugh "要是能白拿限定皮肤，那也太好了！"
    think laugh "If I can get a limited skin for free, that'd be amazing!"

# game/ch01.rpy:60
translate english ch1_B_759d53b8:

    # mc confused "真的全部免费吗？我需要做什么才能领到限定皮肤？"
    mc confused "Is it really all free? What do I need to do to get the limited skin?"

# game/ch01.rpy:62
translate english ch1_B_75fe6a84:

    # fraud laugh "百分百真实！专门给没有零花钱的小学生准备的福利，不用充值、不用花钱，只需要简单登记一下信息就可以秒到账！好多你们学校的同学都领完了，你看这是大家的到账截图！"
    fraud laugh "100% real! This is a special reward for kids with no spending money — no recharge, no spending, just a quick info check and it arrives instantly! A bunch of kids from your school already got theirs. Look — here are the screenshots!"

# game/ch01.rpy:64
translate english ch1_B_e47fa3f3:

    # n "对方连续发送多张高仿官方截图、虚假用户领取反馈图、活动海报，画面逼真、极具迷惑性。"
    n "The other person sent a bunch of fake official screenshots, fake claim screenshots, and event posters — all super realistic and super convincing."

# game/ch01.rpy:65
translate english ch1_B_fe18cc5c:

    # fraud serious "最后两个名额了！你快点操作，晚一秒就被别人抢光，以后再也没有免费皮肤活动了！"
    fraud serious "Only two spots left! Hurry up — if you wait even a second, someone else will grab them. There'll never be another free skin event again!"

# game/ch01.rpy:79
translate english ch1_B1_443db822:

    # n "阿狐压住心里的期待，克制住好奇心，直接退出游戏私信，拿着手机走到客厅找到妈妈。"
    n "Ahu pushed down his excitement and curiosity, left the chat, picked up his phone, and went to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch01.rpy:80
translate english ch1_B1_744d7337:

    # think worried "虽然很想要皮肤，但总觉得不太对劲，还是先问问妈妈吧。"
    think worried "I really want the skin, but something feels off. Better ask Mom first."

# game/ch01.rpy:81
translate english ch1_B1_f85aff7b:

    # mc worried "妈妈，你看有人私聊我说可以免费领游戏皮肤，是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, look — someone messaged me saying I can get a free game skin. Is that real?"

# game/ch01.rpy:83
translate english ch1_B1_8ebb9405:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是专门骗小朋友的骗局哦。游戏官方不会私下找人送皮肤，这些截图都是骗子伪造的。遇到这种陌生免费福利，一定不能自己乱操作，先来问爸爸妈妈就对了。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is a scam made specifically to trick kids. The game company would never privately send skins to people, and those screenshots are all fake. If you ever see a strange free reward offer, don't mess with it on your own — ask Mom or Dad first."

# game/ch01.rpy:84
translate english ch1_B1_21cdb353:

    # n "妈妈指导阿狐删除链接、举报账号、清理陌生私信。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu delete the link, report the account, and clear out the stranger's messages."

# game/ch01.rpy:87
translate english ch1_B1_9c2b12a0:

    # police laugh "遇到陌生福利不慌张，先停顿、不操作、问家长，这是中小学生最靠谱的反诈方式！你做得非常优秀！"
    police laugh "When a random reward offer shows up, don't panic — pause, don't do anything, and ask your parents. That's the safest anti-fraud move for students! You did great!"

# game/ch01.rpy:99
translate english ch1_B2_97d927e3:

    # n "阿狐忍不住好奇，点击对方发送的陌生外链。"
    n "Ahu couldn't resist his curiosity, so he clicked the strange link the other person sent."

# game/ch01.rpy:100
translate english ch1_B2_0fdac0c6:

    # n "手机跳转至高仿官方网页，页面logo、配色、排版和正版游戏几乎一模一样，顶部写着：学生专属福利领取中心。页面提示：填写游戏账号、手机号即可领取绝版皮肤。"
    n "His phone opened a fake official page — the logo, colors, and layout were almost exactly the same as the real game. At the top it said: Student Reward Center. The page prompted: enter your game account and phone number to claim the limited skin."

# game/ch01.rpy:102
translate english ch1_B2_73319704:

    # n "阿狐仔细观察，发现这是浏览器外部网页，不是游戏内置官方弹窗，瞬间产生警惕，立刻关闭网页、退出游戏登录。"
    n "Ahu looked closely and realized it was a browser page, not an in-game official popup. Alarm bells went off instantly, so he closed the page and logged out of the game."

# game/ch01.rpy:103
translate english ch1_B2_e97eb081:

    # think serious "不对，这是浏览器外面的网页，肯定不是官方，我得赶紧告诉妈妈！"
    think serious "Nope — this is an outside browser page. It’s definitely not official. I need to tell Mom right now!"

# game/ch01.rpy:104
translate english ch1_B2_3e2ea910:

    # mc serious "这个页面不是官方的，不对劲，我要告诉妈妈！"
    mc serious "This page isn’t official. Something’s wrong — I’m telling Mom!"

# game/ch01.rpy:107
translate english ch1_B2_a248786f:

    # police serious "陌生外链都是骗子制作的钓鱼假页面，专门盗取小朋友的账号和个人信息。你能够及时发现异常、立刻停止操作，成功守住了自己的账号安全！"
    police serious "Random links are phishing pages made by scammers to steal kids’ accounts and personal info. You noticed something was off and stopped right away — that protected your account!"

# game/ch01.rpy:119
translate english ch1_B3_c6fabbc0:

    # n "阿狐完全相信虚假截图，在钓鱼网页认真填写了自己的游戏账号和手机号码。"
    n "Ahu believed the fake screenshots completely, and he carefully entered his game account and phone number on the phishing page."

# game/ch01.rpy:121
translate english ch1_B3_4f6907c2:

    # fraud laugh "信息收到啦！还差一个短信验证码，你把收到的验证码发给我，皮肤立刻秒到账！"
    fraud laugh "We got your info! Just one more thing — the SMS verification code. Send me the code you get, and the skin will be in your account instantly!"

# game/ch01.rpy:123
translate english ch1_B3_ed0549eb:

    # n "阿狐正要查看短信，突然想起老师的反诈课堂：任何人索要短信验证码都是骗子！"
    n "Ahu was about to check the SMS when he suddenly remembered the anti-fraud lesson: anyone who asks for a verification code is a scammer!"

# game/ch01.rpy:124
translate english ch1_B3_d14c9222:

    # think serious "老师说过，谁要验证码谁就是骗子！"
    think serious "Teacher said: anyone who asks for the code is a scammer!"

# game/ch01.rpy:125
translate english ch1_B3_69672b94:

    # mc serious "我不能给你验证码，你是骗子！"
    mc serious "I’m not giving you the code. You’re a scammer!"

# game/ch01.rpy:128
translate english ch1_B3_f3cb3a69:

    # n "阿狐立刻退出页面，不再回复，拿着手机找到家长说明情况。家长第一时间修改游戏密码，屏蔽陌生骚扰。"
    n "Ahu left the page immediately, stopped replying, and went to tell his parents what happened. They changed the game password right away and blocked the stranger's harassment."

# game/ch01.rpy:131
translate english ch1_B3_3fe91a07:

    # police serious "随意填写账号和手机号，会造成个人信息泄露，引来后续诈骗和骚扰。好在你及时醒悟、终止操作，没有造成更大的损失！"
    police serious "Entering your account and phone number carelessly can leak personal info and lead to more scams and harassment. Luckily, you woke up in time and stopped before it caused bigger losses!"

# game/ch01.rpy:143
translate english ch1_C_9d096ca8:

    # n "阿狐极度想要绝版皮肤，担心名额被抢，快速同意好友申请，主动打字追问。"
    n "Ahu wanted the limited skin so badly that he was scared someone else would grab the spot. He quickly accepted the friend request and started typing, pushing for details."

# game/ch01.rpy:144
translate english ch1_C_d4a321f2:

    # think laugh "绝版皮肤我来了，一定不能让别人抢走！"
    think laugh "Limited skin, here I come! Nobody is taking it from me!"

# game/ch01.rpy:145
translate english ch1_C_d1dff986:

    # mc laugh "你好！我想要限定皮肤，怎么才能领取？我很快的！"
    mc laugh "Hi! I want the limited skin — how do I get it? I can do it fast!"

# game/ch01.rpy:147
translate english ch1_C_b85c5c52:

    # fraud laugh "我特别理解！小朋友没有零花钱买皮肤，所以官方专门开了学生免费通道！全程不收费、不坑人，很多小学生都领到了专属特效和点券，你放心操作！"
    fraud laugh "I totally get it! Kids don’t have pocket money for skins, so the official team opened a special free student channel! No fees, no tricks — tons of students already got their exclusive effects and points. Just follow the steps, no worries!"

# game/ch01.rpy:150
translate english ch1_C_f40c69cc:

    # n "对方发送钓鱼链接，弹出领取硬性要求。"
    n "The other person sent a phishing link and a pop-up appeared with the claim requirements."

# game/ch01.rpy:151
translate english ch1_C_233408bc:

    # fraud serious "必须填写游戏账号、登录密码、短信验证码三项信息，系统才能绑定账号发放皮肤，少一项都无法发货！"
    fraud serious "You have to fill in three things — game account, login password, and SMS verification code — or the system can’t link the account and send the skin. Missing even one step means no delivery!"

# game/ch01.rpy:165
translate english ch1_C1_26be8a3a:

    # n "手指悬在输入框上，即将点击提交，脑海中突然响起反诈口诀：天下没有免费的午餐！免费皮肤全是陷阱！"
    n "His finger hovered over the input box, ready to tap submit, when an anti-fraud line suddenly echoed in his head: there’s no such thing as a free lunch! Free skins are all traps!"

# game/ch01.rpy:166
translate english ch1_C1_868fda15:

    # think serious "等等！天下没有免费的午餐，这一定有问题！"
    think serious "Wait! There's no such thing as a free lunch — something is definitely wrong!"

# game/ch01.rpy:167
translate english ch1_C1_147b2c2c:

    # mc serious "我不要免费皮肤了，你是骗子！"
    mc serious "I don’t want the free skin anymore. You’re a scammer!"

# game/ch01.rpy:170
translate english ch1_C1_32dde2e8:

    # n "阿狐果断关闭网页，删除好友、拉黑账号、一键举报，主动把整件事告诉妈妈和班主任。"
    n "Ahu shut the page immediately, deleted the friend, blocked the account, reported it with one tap, and told Mom and his homeroom teacher everything."

# game/ch01.rpy:172
translate english ch1_C1_1e83f5d2:

    # mom laugh "你能抵住诱惑、及时醒悟，真的非常棒！"
    mom laugh "You were able to resist the temptation and realize it in time — that’s awesome!"

# game/ch01.rpy:175
translate english ch1_C1_9ad9841c:

    # police serious "面对唾手可得的诱惑，能够坚守底线、及时止损，是非常优秀的反诈素养！所有诈骗，都是从贪图小便宜开始的！"
    police serious "When temptation is right in front of you, being able to hold the line and stop in time is excellent anti-fraud awareness! Every scam starts with someone trying to get a little something for free!"

# game/ch01.rpy:187
translate english ch1_C2_a505071f:

    # n "既想要皮肤，又害怕被骗，心存侥幸。阿狐只填写游戏账号和手机号，刻意避开密码和验证码。"
    n "He really wanted the skin, but he was also scared of being scammed, so he took a gamble. Ahu only entered his game account and phone number, avoiding the password and verification code on purpose."

# game/ch01.rpy:190
translate english ch1_C2_c964c55c:

    # n "诈骗分子获取基础信息后，尝试登录账号失败，开始疯狂发送诈骗短信、陌生福利链接、小号骚扰。"
    n "After the scammer got the basic info, their login attempts failed, so they started blasting scam texts, sending shady reward links, and harassing him from fake accounts."

# game/ch01.rpy:192
translate english ch1_C2_056ec320:

    # mc sad "怎么一直有奇怪的消息，好烦！"
    mc sad "Why do I keep getting weird messages? This is so annoying!"

# game/ch01.rpy:195
translate english ch1_C2_d6bfb191:

    # n "阿狐不堪其扰，拿着手机去找妈妈求助。妈妈帮忙屏蔽骚扰、加固账号安全。"
    n "Ahu couldn't stand the constant spam anymore, so he grabbed his phone and went to ask Mom for help. She blocked the harassment and tightened the account security."

# game/ch01.rpy:198
translate english ch1_C2_4ce63ff6:

    # police serious "没有「只填一点信息没事」的骗局！只要泄露个人信息，就会给骗子留下可乘之机，引来二次诈骗和无休止骚扰。"
    police serious "There’s no such thing as ‘it’s fine if I only share a little info.’ Once your personal information leaks, scammers find an opening and you get hit with follow-up scams and endless harassment."

# game/ch01.rpy:210
translate english ch1_C3_4bbac662:

    # n "满心欢喜、毫无防备，一心只想拿到绝版皮肤。阿狐认真完整填写游戏账号、登录密码、手机验证码，点击提交。"
    n "Overjoyed and totally unguarded, Ahu focused only on getting the limited skin. He carefully filled in his game account, login password, and phone verification code, then tapped submit."

# game/ch01.rpy:213
translate english ch1_C3_1edc1829:

    # n "页面瞬间黑屏、刷新、所有福利提示全部消失。"
    n "The page went dark and refreshed instantly, and every reward notice vanished."

# game/ch01.rpy:216
translate english ch1_C3_4934be1c:

    # n "阿狐立刻返回游戏，发现账号被强制下线，再次登录提示密码错误。"
    n "Ahu rushed back to the game and found his account had been logged out. When he tried logging in again, it said the password was wrong."

# game/ch01.rpy:219
translate english ch1_C3_c8636ddb:

    # n "打开聊天框，发现自己已被对方拉黑，好友、私信全部清空。账号内所有皮肤、点券、道具、碎片全部被盗号者清空。"
    n "When he opened the chat, he saw that the scammer had blocked him — all his friends and messages were gone. Every skin, point, item, and fragment in the account had been wiped out by the thief."

# game/ch01.rpy:221
translate english ch1_C3_596c2479:

    # mc sad "我不该相信免费皮肤的，我被骗了……"
    mc sad "I shouldn’t have trusted the free skin... I got scammed..."

# game/ch01.rpy:222
translate english ch1_C3_c34c742e:

    # n "阿狐主动向妈妈坦白全部经过，诚恳认错。"
    n "Ahu confessed everything to Mom and sincerely admitted his mistake."

# game/ch01.rpy:225
translate english ch1_C3_575e88b2:

    # mom normal "没关系，这次经历也是一次成长。天上不会掉免费的礼物，以后遇到这种福利我们坚决不相信就好。"
    mom normal "It’s okay — this is a lesson learned. Free gifts don’t just fall from the sky. From now on, if we see a reward like this, we simply won’t believe it."

# game/ch01.rpy:228
translate english ch1_C3_d57a7775:

    # police serious "小朋友一定要记住！任何索要游戏密码、手机验证码的免费福利，百分百是诈骗！游戏官方永远不会私下索要你的私密账号信息。贪图免费道具，最后只会丢失账号和个人信息。"
    police serious "Kids, remember this! Any free reward that asks for your game password or phone verification code is 100% a scam! The official team will never privately ask for your private account details. Wanting free stuff just ends up costing you your account and personal info."

